.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YbHy2PdiktUQ7kNvwGmvq8y&_nc_oc=Adnzdprxz0JEvMiwOQ6SQr9Jk7lvfrF_mMt_bFvYLJfTslCZCSP71tV3aC9DWWFOjpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxAXds9IMH79PVgBJ0mJAnKiOZuuQ7Rz_DuudzplHts6A&oe=69B80218"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQCwQ5Iydh8Q7kNvwGs96hy&_nc_oc=AdkXE4mT62u40JmzN9x8RK96NT8L-BopFkX71dkSDSmn3ojRlWDn14K_vXpwo-9geQc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzop5lf2hAkBPg0TBaJXUSkd7hj_7_2tKoPve6C4ubs6A&oe=69B7FF40"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SeEaYC6uwQoQ7kNvwFSHIvp&_nc_oc=Admk0ZB48180cDoP3I0p4Azcq9O_-6VFOUjUt_-mlnVqTias0ZgV4CkRJyw8zKZuO_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx26fF_epTRLoVFvih95ZL4yV7UHPMRkVzWx4ErUkOY3A&oe=69B7FF73"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p